.TH AERO 1 "September 2026" "Aero Linux 1.4-Supernova" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
aero \- The Ultra-Lean AI & High-Performance Developer Linux Control Engine
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B aero
[\fIOPTIONS\fR] \fICOMMAND\fR [\fIARGS\fR...]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B aero
is the primary systems engineering, performance tuning, and local AI orchestration suite for Aero Linux.
It provides hardware telemetry, dynamic zRAM compaction, local LLM serving, containerized sandboxes,
encrypted keyrings, network latency tracers, desktop layout switching, and a complete 45-app graphical suite.

.SH CORE COMMANDS
.TP
.B doctor
Run real-time hardware diagnostics (CPU, GPU, RAM, zRAM, Thermals, Battery).
.TP
.B layout \fI[windows|tiling]\fR
Switch desktop between Windows-friendly taskbar mode and Hacker Tiling mode.
.TP
.B memory \fI[--optimize]\fR
Audit RAM allocation, per-process usage, and compact zRAM compression buffers.
.TP
.B power \fI[--set <profile> | --threshold <80>]\fR
Manage TLP power profiles and hardware battery charging thresholds.
.TP
.B ai \fI[init | pull <model> | run <model> | calc | bench]\fR
1-click local LLM inference via Ollama with RAM footprint calculation and TTFT benchmarks.
.TP
.B agent \fI"<prompt>" [--shell]\fR
Terminal-native local AI coding and shell command assistant.
.TP
.B dev run \fI[node|python|rust|go|c]\fR
Launch isolated containerized developer sandboxes in the current directory.
.TP
.B dev setup \fI[node|rust|python|java|docker|c]\fR
1-click native developer toolchain and SDK installer.
.TP
.B db \fI[start|stop|ui] <name>\fR
Manage local background databases (Postgres, Redis, MySQL, Mongo, ClickHouse) and web studio.
.TP
.B vault \fI[set|get|list|export]\fR
Encrypted developer secret keyring and environment variable store.
.TP
.B tunnel \fI<port>\fR
Expose local development port to instant public HTTPS tunnel.
.TP
.B turbo \fI[mount|status|unmount]\fR
Mount high-speed tmpfs RAM-disk for zero-wear 10GB/s compilation acceleration.
.TP
.B store \fI[list|install <app> | search <query>]\fR
1-click developer software center (VS Code, Brave, Docker, Postman, Obsidian) and multi-source search.
.TP
.B wine \fI<app.exe>\fR
Launch standalone Windows applications with GE-Proton and GameMode acceleration.
.TP
.B connect \fI[status | send <file>]\fR
Wireless mobile device synchronization and file beaming.
.TP
.B zoom \fI[in | out | reset | peek]\fR
High-precision display magnification and momentary 2-finger peek zoom.
.TP
.B trace \fI[ping <host> | dns]\fR
Measure network socket connect, TLS handshake, and DNS resolution latency.
.TP
.B clean \fI[--dry-run]\fR
Deep system cache and developer de-bloater cleaner (npm, pip, apt, docker).
.TP
.B flash \fI[drives | write <iso> <dev>]\fR
Safe live USB media flasher.
.TP
.B appimage \fI[install <file.AppImage> | list | remove <slug>]\fR
Integrate portable AppImages into Start Menu with SquashFS icon extraction.
.TP
.B theme \fI[set <palette> | accent <color> | auto]\fR
Manage desktop themes (cyber-cyan, tokyo-night, nord, gruvbox), neon accent highlights, and sun-cycle auto scheduling.
.TP
.B font \fI[list | install <name>]\fR
1-click developer Nerd Font installer (JetBrains Mono, Fira Code, Hack).
.TP
.B net \fI[bbr | dns <provider>]\fR
Enable Google BBR low-latency congestion control or encrypted DNS-over-TLS (Cloudflare, Google, Quad9).
.TP
.B security \fI[audit | harden]\fR
Audit and enforce UFW firewall rules, ASLR memory protection, and kernel dmesg access controls.
.TP
.B snapshot \fI[create | list | restore]\fR
Instant system restore point management with rollback support.
.TP
.B benchmark
Run multi-threaded CPU floating-point and memory bandwidth benchmarks.
.TP
.B calc \fI"<expression>"\fR
Safe AST math and digital byte conversion evaluation.
.TP
.B rec \fI[toggle | start | stop]\fR
Wayland hardware-accelerated screen recording and animated GIF capture.
.TP
.B wear
NVMe SSD endurance, TBW written, and estimated drive lifespan forecaster.
.TP
.B dotfiles \fI[export | import <tar>]\fR
Backup and restore desktop configs and developer dotfiles.

